5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry about who does the extra work. We never name the people until the rota breaks.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about delivery dates. We promise timelines based on conditions we do not control.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The fund is committed before we know the source. The real bill often arrives next year.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We keep funding similar projects. I want to see what happened to the last three winners.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,We judge by how impressive things sound. I want to see the everyday losses on the floor.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@George, that sounds right. If the money is hidden, the work is hidden too.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, exactly. If the hands are not free, the date is a lie.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Jonathan, I agree. The renewal notice is where the pain lives.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@George, I need to see the outcomes. We are repeating mistakes.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, I agree. The floor reality is what matters, not the pitch.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the network coverage at customer plants.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will examine the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will review the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look at the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also check the handling of vendor queries.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the in-house developer availability.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will also check the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I will also check the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
