74,3,3,talk,Midori,,I vote for C. It reduces the everyday loss.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minato,,I am happy we agree. C is the right choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. The data is clear.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
